      "text": "你提供的信息是：每个时间点都有单细胞表达谱，且采样为四个有序时间点。",
      "basis": "USER_PROVIDED_FACT",
      "citations": [],
      "context_fact_ids": ["user:expression_profiles", "user:sampling"]
